{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blackjack Roulette,\u00a0a rogue-like \u201cspin\u201d on two casino classics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930450/extras/732a03e30823a0521fe8cbce4ad01390.poster.avif?t=1774305568\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930450/extras/732a03e30823a0521fe8cbce4ad01390.webm?t=1774305568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930450/extras/732a03e30823a0521fe8cbce4ad01390.mp4?t=1774305568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get as close to 21 without going over and see how you compare against a roulette wheel of hands to beat. If you keep winning, the wheel keeps spinning! After each round, the wheel gets bigger,\u00a0 and so does the Buy-In cost. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can\u2019t afford the Buy-In at the start of a round, it\u2019s <strong>Game Over.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Collect Boules to Give Your Spin a Boost!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930450/extras/70bf102e9626b7dcea6f26cc58f6227d.avif?t=1774305568\" alt=\"\"width=1560 height=401 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Roulette Boules as you spin to get give your current spin a special &quot;boost&quot;.\u00a0 Every round, pick from two random boules to add to your collection. At the start of each table, the boules are spun randomly around the wheel and their effects are trigger if you defeat the hand they land on.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Purchase Insurance to Gain the Edge!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930450/extras/ba9f60503f5485613d9dcbb8e44e8c80.avif?t=1774305568\" alt=\"\"width=1428 height=665 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily for you, this casino will gladly sell you insurance. Insurance Policies offer various upgrades and abilities to help, but they\u2019ll cost you. One policy lets you win on ties <i>(for a small fee, of course)</i>. Another lets you overcharge your hand over 21 without busting, but will auto-play your next 5 hands automatically. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press your luck and take out the Pit Bosses in <strong>Blackjack Roulette</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blackjack with a roulette \u201cspin\u201d and unique Insurance Policies that make each run different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hand you defeat gets added to your pocket and are used the next time you lose your hand. And the end of a round, your cash out is based on your Buy-In and your Pocket Size</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ unique &quot;Insurance Policies&quot;, each with different abilities, all based on real world insurance policies (yes, even <i>Ketchup Insurance</i>).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24+ Boules that add special effects and a little chaos to every spin!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Challenge Modes that offer new, and usually harder, ways to play.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930450?t=17743055