ass=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press your luck and take out the Pit Bosses in <strong>Blackjack Roulette</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blackjack with a roulette \u201cspin\u201d and unique Insurance Policies that make each run different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hand you defeat gets added to your pocket and are used the next time you lose your hand. And the end of a round, your cash out is based on your Buy-In and your Pocket Size</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ unique &quot;Insurance Policies&quot;, each with different abilities, all based on real world insurance policies (yes, even <i>Ketchup Insurance</i>).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24+ Boules that add special effects and a little chaos to every spin!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Challenge Modes that offer new, and usually harder, ways to play.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Reactvts"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930450/8bc0fc1526c1a6a5b1ffd7f0fcbeeecec9bccc25/header.jpg?t=1774305568","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo SU9400 or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 5500</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930450/645167413/52e38caff4f8b5ce46cd0cb53ee4b596d9549ce9/1773594242/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773598489","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930450/645167413/52e38c